msgstr "Gennaio 2026 {#january-2026-2}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See the [v0.15.2 release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"transpiler/release-notes#0152-2026-01-13).\n"
msgstr ""
"Consulta le [note di rilascio "
"v0.15.2](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-transpiler/release-"
"notes#0152-2026-01-13).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
